"我了解风险，写入候选字段" = "I understand the risks, write candidate fields";
"极高风险：iPadOS 设备类别" = "Extreme risk: iPadOS device class";
"将修改二进制 CacheData 中的设备类别。已有 iPhone 实测出现音频、麦克风、电话、相机视频失效；重启不会自动修复。只有恢复原始字段并再次重启才能尝试排除。" = "This changes the device class in binary CacheData. On some iPhones it has disabled audio, the microphone, calls, and camera video. Restarting alone did not fix it; restoring the original values and restarting again may help.";
"我承担风险，写入设备类别" = "I take the risk and write the device class";
"恢复外接屏实验" = "Restore external screen experiment";
"只回退本实验的七个能力字段及设备类别。若相关字段已被其他工具改动，YumEdit 会拒绝覆盖。当前缓存仍会先另存备份。" = "Only the seven capability fields and equipment categories of this experiment will be rolled back. If the relevant fields have been modified by other tools, YumEdit will refuse to overwrite them. The current cache will still be backed up first.";
"正在备份并写入 MobileGestalt…" = "Backing up and writing to MobileGestalt…";
"外接屏扩展 · 实验" = "External screen expansion · Experiment";
"进入外接屏实验" = "Enter the external screen experiment";
"分阶段测试台前调度、iPad 能力和设备类别；尚未在 iOS 27 真机证明扩展桌面可用。" = "Phased testing of front-end scheduling, iPad capabilities, and device categories; extended desktop availability has not yet been demonstrated on iOS 27 devices.";
"高风险：外接屏实验" = "High risk: external screen experiment";
"本实验可能更改 iPadOS 设备类别，已有机型出现音频、麦克风、电话及相机视频失效。请先完成整机备份，并准备好用原始 plist 恢复。此功能尚未证明能在 iOS 27 启用扩展桌面。" = "This experiment may change the iPadOS device category, and existing models may experience audio, microphone, phone, and camera video failures. Please complete a full machine backup first and be ready to restore with the original plist. This feature has not been proven to enable extended desktop in iOS 27.";
"我了解风险，进入实验" = "I understand the risks and enter the experiment";
"外接屏实验仅支持 iOS 27 及以上的 iPhone" = "The external screen experiment only supports iPhones with iOS 27 and above.";
"候选字段已写入并校验。重启后连接外接屏测试；目前没有证明扩展桌面已启用。原始状态另存为 ExternalDisplayBaseline。" = "Candidate fields have been written and verified. After restarting, connect the external screen for testing; there is currently no proof that the extended desktop is enabled. The original state is saved as ExternalDisplayBaseline.";
"请先执行候选字段阶段，保存实验前基线" = "Please execute the candidate field stage first and save the pre-experiment baseline";
"iPadOS 设备类别已写入并校验。重启后测试外接屏与音频、麦克风、电话和相机；扩展桌面不保证成功。" = "iPadOS device class written and verified. Test the external screen and audio, microphone, phone, and camera after restarting; extending the desktop is not guaranteed to succeed.";
"外接屏实验恢复仅支持 iPhone" = "External screen experimental recovery only supports iPhone";
"找不到本机外接屏实验基线；请从 GestaltBackups 选择同一设备的完整备份恢复" = "The local external screen experimental baseline cannot be found; please select a full backup restore of the same device from GestaltBackups";
"已恢复外接屏实验前的相关字段与设备类别，并保留其他当前修改。请重启设备。" = "The relevant fields and device categories before the external screen experiment have been restored, and other current modifications have been retained. Please restart your device.";
"外接屏实验字段已被其他操作改动；为避免覆盖，已拒绝写入或恢复" = "The experimental field of the external screen has been modified by other operations; to avoid overwriting, writing or recovery has been refused.";
"CacheData 与实验前基线不匹配；已拒绝覆盖，请使用完整备份检查" = "CacheData does not match pre-lab baseline; overwrite denied, please use full backup check";

"旧机型 Siri AI 尚未独立复现；伪装身份可能影响 Face ID" = "Older-device Siri AI has not been independently reproduced; identity spoofing may affect Face ID";
"实验性选项" = "Experimental options";
"高风险：实验性选项" = "High risk: experimental options";
"外接屏与硬件身份恢复均未经当前设备验证，可能影响音频、Face ID 或系统稳定性。请先备份整机。各项写入仍会再次确认。" = "External display and hardware identity recovery are unverified on this device and may affect audio, Face ID, or system stability. Back up your device first. Each write requires another confirmation.";
"我了解风险，进入实验性选项" = "I understand the risks; open experiments";
"仅支持 iPhone 与 iPad 的硬件身份恢复" = "Hardware identity recovery supports only iPhone and iPad";
"已从历史备份恢复真实硬件身份，保留当前区域、AI 能力与 SiriMode，并读回校验。请重启后检查 Face ID 与 Siri AI；两者是否可同时使用仍未经验证。" = "Restored real hardware identity from a historical backup while keeping the current region, AI capability, and SiriMode. Read-back verified. Restart and check Face ID and Siri AI; using both together remains unverified.";
"仅支持 iOS 27 及以上的非原生 Siri AI iPhone" = "Only supported on iOS 27 or later iPhones without native Siri AI";
"已在 CacheExtra 新增或设置 SiriMode=2，并读回校验；未伪装机型。重启后检查 Siri AI、听写和 Face ID。文件可读不代表系统采用此值。" = "Added or set SiriMode=2 in CacheExtra and verified the file, without spoofing the model. Restart and check Siri AI, dictation, and Face ID. Reading the file does not prove iOS uses this value.";
"找不到本机 SiriMode 实验基线，未写入" = "No SiriMode experiment baseline for this device; nothing written";
"已恢复 SiriMode 实验前的原值，其他字段未改动。请重启设备。" = "Restored the pre-experiment SiriMode value without changing other fields. Restart the device.";
"当前硬件身份字段不完整，未写入" = "Current hardware identity fields are incomplete; nothing written";
"产品型号已是真实机型，无需恢复" = "Product model already matches the real device; no restore needed";
"当前身份与 YumEdit 已知伪装配置不一致，未写入" = "Current identity does not match a known YumEdit spoof profile; nothing written";
"找不到同设备且 CacheData 一致的伪装前备份，未写入" = "No pre-spoof backup for this device with matching CacheData; nothing written";
"实验结果需要在真机重启后验证。" = "Verify results on a real device after restarting.";
"以下功能未经当前设备验证；写入成功不代表系统会启用功能。" = "These features are unverified on this device. A successful write does not mean iOS enables the feature.";
"SiriMode 独立实验" = "SiriMode-only experiment";
"只新增 SiriMode=2，不伪装产品、板号或芯片。用于区分字段缺失与身份伪装的影响；低于 A17 Pro 设备启用 Siri AI 尚无独立复现。" = "Adds only SiriMode=2, without spoofing product, board, or chip. This separates a missing field from identity spoofing. Siri AI on devices below A17 Pro has not been independently reproduced.";
"仅新增 SiriMode=2" = "Add only SiriMode=2";
"恢复 SiriMode 实验前值" = "Restore pre-experiment SiriMode";
"Face ID 排障实验" = "Face ID troubleshooting experiment";
"从历史备份恢复真实产品、板号、芯片与监管型号，保留美区、AI 标记和 SiriMode。可能恢复 Face ID，也可能使 Siri AI 失效。" = "Restore the real product, board, chip, and regulatory model from historical backups while keeping the US region, AI flag, and SiriMode. Face ID may recover, or Siri AI may stop working.";
"恢复真实硬件身份" = "Restore real hardware identity";
"分阶段测试 iPad 多任务能力和设备类别。可能损坏音频、通话或相机视频；扩展桌面尚未得到验证。" = "Test iPad multitasking capabilities and device class in stages. Audio, calls, or camera video may break; extended desktop remains unverified.";
"高风险：仅新增 SiriMode" = "High risk: add SiriMode only";
"只在非原生 Siri AI 的 iOS 27 iPhone 上向 CacheExtra 写入 SiriMode=2。保留真实机型。是否被系统采用、能否启用 Siri AI 均未经验证；写入前会备份。" = "Writes SiriMode=2 to CacheExtra only on iOS 27 iPhones without native Siri AI. Keeps the real model. Whether iOS uses the value or enables Siri AI is unverified. A backup is made first.";
"我了解风险，新增字段" = "I understand the risks; add the field";
"恢复 SiriMode 实验" = "Restore SiriMode experiment";
"只恢复本实验开始前的 SiriMode 原值。若 CacheData 已变化，将拒绝写入；当前缓存会先备份。" = "Restore only the SiriMode value from before this experiment. Refuse to write if CacheData changed. Back up the current cache first.";
"恢复原值" = "Restore original value";
"高风险：恢复真实硬件身份" = "High risk: restore real hardware identity";
"仅在 AI 模型已下载后尝试。从历史备份寻找同设备、同 CacheData 的伪装前身份，恢复产品、板号、芯片与监管型号；保留美区和 SiriMode。可能恢复 Face ID，也可能令 Siri AI 失效。找不到精确备份就拒绝写入。" = "Try only after AI models have downloaded. Find a pre-spoof backup for this device with matching CacheData; restore product, board, chip, and regulatory model while keeping the US region and SiriMode. Face ID may recover, or Siri AI may stop working. Refuse without an exact backup.";
"我了解风险，恢复硬件身份" = "I understand the risks; restore hardware identity";
"此实验可能更改 iPadOS 设备类别，已有机型出现音频、麦克风、电话及相机视频失效。请先完成整机备份；扩展桌面尚未得到验证。" = "This experiment may change the iPadOS device class. Audio, microphone, calls, and camera video have failed on some devices. Make a full backup first. Extended desktop remains unverified.";
